_oc=Adp_8FTd--KHtc0wd_6X4eE3K6z6x-wcn5CO-URKb7aduoIaHOM_VMHrdXZ_-Ef-aoE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4cN9X40WPNQpBUE2pDh-ICt8eTwRzb-WjVSQ6RcskZgg&oe=69FC9D35"}, {"file_name": "barbarians_1.png", "id": "25763710536645694", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308575_25763710539979027_8740020352861949051_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=phhIsAJcTX4Q7kNvwHM-fus&_nc_oc=Adov3mC6urWmGIRhTvHNIyLR6hNaef9ofqZ45_nvGrG1Jdb66qKiqtQSwAF2uGJXK8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41oLuJ4YgnmQij_d0O9OSR-vPxzUiNNrtpiLqLFGce0A&oe=69FC7E07"}, {"file_name": "barbarians_6.png", "id": "914702717967498", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_914702721300831_2099597177216149039_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jAUe8wpNDvQQ7kNvwGvy-XM&_nc_oc=Adp90fM3TUUHHDkJ-ndUBcCxLyO37Lf4p-7CGBnfxkqnJCa-ss3PkEBthTMQemV8iME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7MayfedVUetg10_Ci29uAu4UMeivE68KpVLTkKhLuFZA&oe=69FC7CE0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AG_2560x1440_DragonV3.png", "id": "1626088662017657", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300897_1626088665350990_5509966284567400807_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xtf6ktBqkpkQ7kNvwHFGsN3&_nc_oc=Adp_L1QojYZS5WfzYHTmtuHahY5fX7HvUo7uz2ZdwHncikRlraz-EU9nMA0u08BjtPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af73h0h7BSuHUYz-w7Zc9nIBHtAubo-lWPzWYbWydYaz_A&oe=69FC8219"}, "display_name": "Animal Guys", "keywords": ["gorilla", "explore", "pets", "dragon", "viking"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                                                                                                                                                   \n{1211805520763804}\n\n# A new hero enters the wild. \u2694\ufe0f\nStep into the armor of the Knight, a fearless new skin ready to charge into chaos, explore dangerous worlds, and take on every challenge with style.                                                                                                                                                    \n\n{25773951658933972}\n\n#  Enter the age of Savage Evolution\n\n\n\n The world of Animal Guys just got wilder. Transform into **primal new skins** \u2014 **Cavemen and Monkeys** \u2014 and unleash your untamed side as you charge through dangerous landscapes, cause hilarious chaos with friends, and explore like never before.\n\n{2359547311189609}\n\nJourney across the lush **Valley** \ud83c\udf3f, push your survival instincts on the frozen** Ice Mountain** \u2744\ufe0f, and brave the molten dangers of the **Volcano** \ud83c\udf0b. Each world grows more intense as you advance, rewarding bold explorers who dare to go further.\n\nYou won\u2019t face the wild alone. Team up with **loyal Wolves \ud83d\udc3a, powerful Bears \ud83d\udc3b, fierce Tigers \ud83d\udc2f, and legendary Dragons \ud83d\udc09**. Wander together, level up your companions, and create unforgettable moments as you run, clash, and laugh your way through unpredictable encounters.\n\n{1591983862037956}\n\nWhether you\u2019re racing across terrain, stirring up multiplayer mayhem, or forging your own primal legend, **Savage Evolution brings a louder, funnier, and more chaotic energy to every adventure.**\n\nThe wild is calling \u2014 gather your crew, embrace the chaos, and evolve.\n\nAnd don't miss the #wild-talk in our Discord channel >> **https://discord.com/channels/1014620047827804281/1386750138390941776**\n\n", "short_description": "Go primal in the Savage Evolution update \u2014 become a Caveman or Monkey, conquer dangerous worlds, and explore alongside Wolves, Bears, Tigers, a